@startuml 002-sheets-import-class
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title SF-02 匯入資料模型（FR-02、FR-08）
class "Activity\nactivities" as Activity
class "Unit\nunits" as Unit {
  id
  kind
  group_code
  position
}
class "Question\nquestions" as Question {
  question_key
  position / position_in_unit
  spreadsheet_id / sheet_id / sheet_title
  row_index / column_index
  original_marker
}
class ImportPreview {
  previewId
  activityId / teacher session
  expiresAt
  spreadsheetId
  units / questionCount
}
Activity "1" *-- "0..*" Unit
Unit "1" *-- "1..*" Question
ImportPreview ..> Activity
ImportPreview ..> Unit : 確認後整批取代
note right of Question
  題號活動內唯一
  格位為 0-based
  一格只對應一個題號
end note
@enduml
